[{"id":3892710490,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7oBgxa","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally (rebased on top of `master` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/c53c5a1f49fa1edf97e6b570297c90a57d30a558), it mostly works as expected. This will be a nice usability boost for CSG in particular 🙂 \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b594a16-852b-4dee-b1b0-ed8d1c4d7d4b\n\nSome feedback:\n\n- When using relative positioning, CSG gizmos don't update until you move your mouse over one of the handles:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a8e4c0a-b8cd-4768-9a8a-b5cd23831901","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109680#pullrequestreview-3892710490","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109680","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109680#pullrequestreview-3892710490"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109680"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-04T23:52:29Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3905587482,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7oyoka","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Works great now 🙂 Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nI think the Pin icon is a better choice for now. Ideally, we'll want a custom design but I am not sure what would convey the idea of \"parent is transformed without affecting children\" well.\r\n\r\nPS: As an aside, modifying position/rotation/scale properties in the inspector while this mode is enabled *does* affect the properties in the same way as if you were using the gizmos. This is probably not a bug and can be useful for manual entry, but it can be a little surprising. Maybe it should be denoted in the tooltip.\r\n\r\n@Jesusemora While testing this PR, I noticed CSG autosmooth is affected by non-uniform scaling:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ed92596-0f2a-4179-8698-833f12d4c9cf\r\n\r\nNotice how the house (which is a child of the Ground node I'm editing) has its wall being autosmoothed, even though it shouldn't at the default angle of 50°.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if this can be fixed, but I thought I'd report it just in case. The issue doesn't seem to occur with uniform scaling. To test this, use the MRP I posted in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116749, move the ground away from the house and scale it non-uniformly with parent transforms enabled using this PR.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109680#pullrequestreview-3905587482","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109680","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109680#pullrequestreview-3905587482"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109680"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-06T19:25:18Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3908913780,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7o_Up0","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?u=ec87bf81cd2f5f0947670400f48cf0845c25d719&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109680#pullrequestreview-3908913780","pull_request_url":"https://api.git